{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The flock of Jet[D#m]hro went to Horeb, the mountain [F#]of God, where the desert wind had [C#]blown
A bush was blazing in the [D#m]rocks and still it was not [B]burned
He turned a[G#m]side to see the sight, and God called [A#]as [D#m]he turned
Moses, Moses
Here I am
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Take off [B]your sandals
[D#m]For the place where you [C#]are standing is holy [B]ground
