I [G#m]AM [A#]has sent me to [D#m]you
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
I have surely seen the misery [F#]of my people in Egypt
[D#m]I have heard them crying out
[F#]I know their sufferings
[C#]So I have come down to rescue [D#m]them
Into a good and spacious [B]land
A land flowing [G#m]with milk and hon[A#]ey
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
